    "updated_at": "2022-02-16T10:23:08Z",
    "body": "It looks like [`curl` is having issues with your network](https://everything.curl.dev/usingcurl/returns). You can try debugging this with `curl` verbose mode:\r\n```\r\n curl --fail --verbose --location --output /tmp/starship.tar.gz https://github.com/starship/starship/releases/latest/download/starship-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz\r\n```\r\n\r\nArch also ships starship in the community repositories, so you could also try using `pacman -S starship` as a workaround.",
